¬â€ without predicting anything\n- do not include an h1 title line in the body\n\nOutput EXACTLY this structure (no preamble, no commentary):\nTITLE: <descriptive headline about the story's event>\nDESCRIPTION: <aim for 125 characters of faithful meta description (the gate window is 100-150 characters)>\nSUMMARY: <aim for 55 words in three or four FULL faithful sentences (the gate window is 40-70 words)>\nTWEET: <one faithful share sentence with one emoji, no hashtags>\nTAGS: <three to five comma-separated topic tags>\nBODY:\n<the markdown body>","promptDigest":"sha256:0fa0ac56c02447625a59d0bd66d02f8960176accd2faeb176ffa21a90f83803a","promptCharacters":20390},"references":{"slug":"indigenous-leaders-confront-the-collision-of-climate-and-extraction","path":"/home/emsenn/info/lib/emsenn/services/561-group/services/rsc-quiescent/services/koios-news/sites/koios.news/content/posts/indigenous-leaders-confront-the-collision-of-climate-and-extraction.md","changed":true,"sourceUrlCount":1,"referenceCount":1,"kind":"producing-content.source-cycle.references"},"internalLinks":{"slug":"indigenous-leaders-confront-the-collision-of-climate-and-extraction","path":"/home/emsenn/info/lib/emsenn/services/561-group/services/rsc-quiescent/services/koios-news/sites/koios.news/content/posts/indigenous-leaders-confront-the-collision-of-climate-and-extraction.md","changed":true,"suggestions":[{"targetSlug":"england-sinking-homes-insurance-climate-risk-withdrawal","targetPath":"/posts/england-sinking-homes-insurance-climate-risk-withdrawal","targetHeadline":"England's Sinking Homes Are an Early Notice of Insurance Climate Risk Withdrawal","matchedTerms":["climate breakdown","climate","breakdown"],"confidence":0.57,"markdownLink":"[England's Sinking Homes Are an Early Notice of Insurance Climate Risk Withdrawal](/posts/england-sinking-homes-insurance-climate-risk-withdrawal)","writingGuidance":"Consider this same-site link only if the draft body makes a local, sourced claim about: climate b